<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2890 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2890 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.2890 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.4300 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 7		   May 6</p>
<p> High			     75.4500		 75.4650</p>
<p> Low				75.2500		 75.2801</p>
<p> Open			     75.3500		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.2890		 75.4300</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  5.180		   1.350</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
